        <div data-pjax="true" data-test-selector="body-content" data-view-component="true" class="markdown-body tmp-my-3"><p>Merging a few more PRs.</p>
<ul>
<li>Export worker from ffmpeg package (thanks <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/ntnyq/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/ntnyq">@ntnyq</a> , <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2758393269" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/issues/805" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/pull/805/hovercard" href="https://github.com/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/pull/805">#805</a> ), export worker in core-mt package as well (thanks <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/dumbmoron/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/dumbmoron">@dumbmoron</a> , <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2182794135" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/issues/703" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/pull/703/hovercard" href="https://github.com/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/pull/703">#703</a> )</li>
<li>Add solidstart / vite app (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2404360572" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/issues/765" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/pull/765/hovercard" href="https://github.com/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/pull/765">#765</a> , thanks <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/EmoPorEmilio/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/EmoPorEmilio">@EmoPorEmilio</a>)</li>
<li>Fix SvelteKit example URL (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2229240463" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/issues/720" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/pull/720/hovercard" href="https://github.com/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/pull/720">#720</a>, thanks <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/elvisvoer/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/elvisvoer">@elvisvoer</a>)</li>
<li>Export types within @ffmpeg/ffmpeg (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2229839027" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/issues/723" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/pull/723/hovercard" href="https://github.com/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/pull/723">#723</a> , thanks <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/snelsi/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/snelsi">@snelsi</a>)</li>
</ul></div>
</div>
  <div data-view-component="true" class="Box-footer">          <div class="tmp-mb-3">
            <h3 data-view-component="true" class="mb-2 tmp-mb-2">Contributors</h3>
            <ul class="list-style-none d-flex flex-wrap mb-n2">
    <li class="mb-2 mr-2"
        >
