        <div data-pjax="true" data-test-selector="body-content" data-view-component="true" class="markdown-body tmp-my-3"><p>Hi all! New maintainer here, first working release. Had a few hiccups with npm versioning so this is later, but changes here include:</p>
<ul>
<li>the biggest change, <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2494320069" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/issues/776" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/pull/776/hovercard" href="https://github.com/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/pull/776">#776</a> , <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/izogfif/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/izogfif">@izogfif</a> 's PR to expose <code>ffprobe</code></li>
<li><a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="1989343206" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/issues/627" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/pull/627/hovercard" href="https://github.com/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/pull/627">#627</a>, <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/asticode/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/asticode">@asticode</a> 's PR exposing @ffmpeg/util as a module (and re-releasing util)</li>
<li>Three docs / URL fixes: <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2527586340" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/issues/779" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/pull/779/hovercard" href="https://github.com/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/pull/779">#779</a> (thanks @ksorv ),  <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2416002259" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/issues/766" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/pull/766/hovercard" href="https://github.com/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/pull/766">#766</a> (thanks <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/tommyjepsen/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/tommyjepsen">@tommyjepsen</a> ),  and <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2570086329" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/issues/783" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/pull/783/hovercard" href="https://github.com/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/pull/783">#783</a> (thanks <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/gubo97000/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/gubo97000">@gubo97000</a> )</li>
</ul>
<p>Build here is courtesy of <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/nathancahill/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/nathancahill">@nathancahill</a> !</p>
<p>Let me know if any issues, should be able to merge some more of these open PRs in the coming days!</p></div>
</div>
