        <div data-pjax="true" data-test-selector="body-content" data-view-component="true" class="markdown-body tmp-my-3"><h2>What's Changed</h2>
<ul>
<li>Solve the problem that the default ffmpeg-core.js cannot be loaded in esm mode by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/xiaomingge1993/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/xiaomingge1993">@xiaomingge1993</a> in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="1936999260" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/issues/601" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/pull/601/hovercard" href="https://github.com/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/pull/601">#601</a></li>
<li>Fix typo in FAQ by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/vkzrx/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/vkzrx">@vkzrx</a> in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="1946162007" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/issues/606" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/pull/606/hovercard" href="https://github.com/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/pull/606">#606</a></li>
<li>Bump @babel/traverse from 7.22.8 to 7.23.2 by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="organization" data-hovercard-url="/orgs/dependabot/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/dependabot">@dependabot</a> in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="1952027758" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/issues/610" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/pull/610/hovercard" href="https://github.com/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/pull/610">#610</a></li>
<li>Providing webpackIgnore is crucial for a successful Webpack build. by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/baszczewski/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/baszczewski">@baszczewski</a> in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="1953601254" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/issues/613" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/pull/613/hovercard" href="https://github.com/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/pull/613">#613</a></li>
<li>Fix typo by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/EstebanDalelR/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/EstebanDalelR">@EstebanDalelR</a> in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2036935719" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/issues/643" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/pull/643/hovercard" href="https://github.com/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/pull/643">#643</a></li>
<li>add export entry for wasm and worker files by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/jichang/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/jichang">@jichang</a> in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2027838876" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/issues/642" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/pull/642/hovercard" href="https://github.com/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/pull/642">#642</a></li>
<li>Bump vite from 4.4.7 to 4.4.12 by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="organization" data-hovercard-url="/orgs/dependabot/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/dependabot">@dependabot</a> in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2027401652" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/issues/641" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/pull/641/hovercard" href="https://github.com/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/pull/641">#641</a></li>
<li>Bump next from 13.4.13 to 13.5.0 by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="organization" data-hovercard-url="/orgs/dependabot/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/dependabot">@dependabot</a> in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="1960642428" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/issues/618" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/pull/618/hovercard" href="https://github.com/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/pull/618">#618</a></li>
