<li>Upgrade nextjs version and fix example by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/jeromewu/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/jeromewu">@jeromewu</a> in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2045022166" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/issues/649" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/pull/649/hovercard" href="https://github.com/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/pull/649">#649</a></li>
